# Game names: world object names in the game client's language, each file read
# by that client language alone. The files live with the translations (the one
# folder that holds non-ASCII text); listed here they come in with this module,
# so the locale addon is never loaded for them.
..\EllesmereUILocales\deDE_GameNames.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale deDE]
..\EllesmereUILocales\esES_GameNames.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale esES]
..\EllesmereUILocales\esMX_GameNames.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale esMX]
..\EllesmereUILocales\frFR_GameNames.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale frFR]
